Meta-port that installs all 11 Python skills for Prime Agent.

Individual skills can be installed independently, e.g.:
  pkg install py312-prime-agent-skill-websearch

Skills included:
  agent-message        - Session-to-session messaging
  agent-observe        - Session observation
  attach-image         - Image attachment processing (needs Pillow)
  compact            - Context compaction
  edit               - In-context file editing
  goal               - Goal management
  linear            - Linear integration (needs httpx, mcp)
  notion            - Notion integration (needs httpx, mcp)
  refine             - Harness refinement
  rlm-heartbeat     - Heartbeat monitoring
  websearch          - Web search (needs httpx)

All skills depend on py-prime-agent-runtime.
